267
00:09:39,500 --> 00:09:41,780
Business and banking groups sued.

268
00:09:41,780 --> 00:09:43,840
The rule never took effect,

269
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,437
and on April fifteenth,

270
00:09:45,437 --> 00:09:46,802
twenty twenty-five,

271
00:09:46,802 --> 00:09:49,716
it was vacated by a court order.

272
00:09:49,950 --> 00:09:51,002
Meanwhile,

273
00:09:51,002 --> 00:09:52,890
a lot of card debt is going

274
00:09:52,890 --> 00:09:53,750
bad.

275
00:09:53,750 --> 00:09:55,539
The New York Fed reports that close

276
00:09:55,539 --> 00:09:58,000
to seven percent of card balances were

277
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:00,438
